# Wombat Home Loans

> Sydney mortgage broker for corporate professionals — first homes, next moves, refinancing, and the complicated bits in between.

## About

Wombat Home Loans is run by Tom Carr, a Sydney-based mortgage broker with 20+ years of institutional banking experience (Citigroup, UBS, RBS, Commonwealth Bank). Tom helps corporate professionals navigate Australian home loans — bonus income, RSUs, first homes, refinancing and investment.

